"title": "IIM Bangalore to celebrate its 53rd Foundation Day with special lecture on ‘India’s Energy Journey: IndianOil’s Role in Securing Energy, Navigating Geopolitics and Building Resilience’",
"standfirst": "Talk to be delivered by IndianOil Chairman Shri A S Sahney",
"start": "2026-10-28",
