"id": "ispma-2027",
"title": "Centre for Software and IT Management (CSITM) to host the 9th India Software Product Management Summit",
"standfirst": "Three-day summit in collaboration with the International Software Product Management Association to explore product management in the age of Agentic AI",
"start": "2027-02-11",
